me></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIMIZU, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, MASAAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A refrigerator using an inflammable refrigerant capable of reducing the risk of fire which may occur when defrosting is performed under the environment that the inflammable refrigerant leaks, comprising an evaporator (10) of a refrigerating cycle using inflammable refrigerant and defrosting means (18) defrosting the evaporator (10), wherein the temperature of the defrosting means (18) is maintained at less than the ignition temperature of the inflammable refrigerant.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un réfrigérateur utilisant un frigorigène inflammable qui peut réduire les risques d'incendie lorsque le dégivrage est effectué dans des conditions de fuite de frigorigène. Ce réfrigérateur comprend un évaporateur (10) faisant partie d'un cycle frigorifique utilisant un frigorigène inflammable, et un moyen de dégivrage (18) assurant le dégivrage de l'évaporateur (10), la température du moyen de dégivrage (18) étant maintenue à une valeur inférieure à la température d'inflammation du frigorigène inflammable.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>